# StudentRentalsScraper – Cursor rule

This project is a **Java 21 / Maven** pipeline: **scrape → post-process → clean → (optional) geocode → (optional) APIs**. Entry point: `src/main/java/main/Orchestrator.java`. Run mode is chosen via CLI (`--mode=...`), with defaults in `src/main/resources/pipeline.properties`.

For full structure, pipeline stages, data model (Apartment, FeatureType, Flag), scraper/cleaner/geocoding/API behavior, config, and open work, read **CONTEXT.md** at the project root and **tickets/** for deferred items.

Do not rely on README.md alone for accuracy; use CONTEXT.md and the code.
